{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-08-13 09:00:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL PLATTS TO PUBLISH NEW LOW-CARBON METALS SPREADS, RATIOS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, AUG. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P GLOBAL PLATTS ("PLATTS"), THE LEADING INDEPENDENT PROVIDER OF INFORMATION AND BENCHMARK PRICES FOR THE COMMODITIES AND ENERGY MARKETS, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS LAUNCHED A SUITE OF EIGHT NEW GLOBAL LOW-CARBON METALS SPREADS AND RATIOS AS PART OF ITS EXPANDED CARBON-ACCOUNTED PRICE OFFERINGS. \xa0 THESE NEW CALCULATED SPREADS AND RATIOS, UNDERPINNED BY EXISTING PLATTS ASSESSMENTS IN HOT-ROLLED STEEL, PIG IRON, SCRAP, IRON ORE AND ALUMINUM FROM THE US, CHINA, TURKEY AND THE BLACK SEA REGION, ALIGN WITH PLATTS\' STRATEGIC FOCUS ON OFFERING CARBON-ACCOUNTED COMMODITIES PRICING INFORMATION.'}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-08-13 09:00:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL PLATTS TO PUBLISH NEW LOW-CARBON METALS SPREADS, RATIOS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, AUG. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P GLOBAL PLATTS ("PLATTS"), THE LEADING INDEPENDENT PROVIDER OF INFORMATION AND BENCHMARK PRICES FOR THE COMMODITIES AND ENERGY MARKETS, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS LAUNCHED A SUITE OF EIGHT NEW GLOBAL LOW-CARBON METALS SPREADS AND RATIOS AS PART OF ITS EXPANDED CARBON-ACCOUNTED PRICE OFFERINGS. \xa0 THESE NEW CALCULATED SPREADS AND RATIOS, UNDERPINNED BY EXISTING PLATTS ASSESSMENTS IN HOT-ROLLED STEEL, PIG IRON, SCRAP, IRON ORE AND ALUMINUM FROM THE US, CHINA, TURKEY AND THE BLACK SEA REGION, ALIGN WITH PLATTS\' STRATEGIC FOCUS ON OFFERING CARBON-ACCOUNTED COMMODITIES PRICING INFORMATION.'}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-08-13 09:00:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL PLATTS TO PUBLISH NEW LOW-CARBON METALS SPREADS, RATIOS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, AUG. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P GLOBAL PLATTS ("PLATTS"), THE LEADING INDEPENDENT PROVIDER OF INFORMATION AND BENCHMARK PRICES FOR THE COMMODITIES AND ENERGY MARKETS, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS LAUNCHED A SUITE OF EIGHT NEW GLOBAL LOW-CARBON METALS SPREADS AND RATIOS AS PART OF ITS EXPANDED CARBON-ACCOUNTED